@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

title Display settings in NINA plugin panel

actor User
participant "NINA Plugin Settings UI" as NINA
participant "OptionsView.xaml" as OptionsView
participant "RATrendCompensatorPlugin" as Plugin
participant "PluginSettings" as Settings
participant "NINA Profile Store" as Store

User -> NINA: Open plugin settings page
NINA -> OptionsView: Load view
OptionsView -> Plugin: Read static ProfileService
OptionsView -> Settings: new(ProfileService)

OptionsView -> Store: Get Host/Port/Enabled/Verbose
Store --> OptionsView: Current values
OptionsView -> Store: Get LaunchApp/ExecutablePath/Arguments/PlotHistoryHours
Store --> OptionsView: Current values
OptionsView --> User: Show populated settings controls

User -> OptionsView: Edit values (lost focus / checkbox change)
OptionsView -> Settings: Set properties
Settings -> Store: Persist values by plugin GUID
@enduml
